WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.324
A shared bill should end with everyone
certain—

2
00:00:03.344 --> 00:00:05.334
and no one chasing screenshots.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.282
FINALTab turns a receipt into a
deterministic ledger,

4
00:00:09.544 --> 00:00:13.032
binds each debtor's USDC pull to the whole
payout plan,

5
00:00:13.398 --> 00:00:15.946
then sends the exact call through
KeeperHub.

6
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.680
Sign in. Scan a crowded receipt.

7
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.360
Correct the extraction. Add participants.

8
00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:26.100
Describe who had what. FINALTab reconciles
every line—

9
00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.196
tax, tip, and service included—

10
00:00:28.216 --> 00:00:29.020
to the cent.

11
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.210
A four-stage review attests the current
inputs;

12
00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:36.390
any edit invalidates it.

13
00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:38.790
Freeze only after a fresh review,

14
00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:43.820
and the ledger, debits, payouts, chain,
and contract become one immutable plan.

15
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.530
Circle permits the USDC pull;

16
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.060
FINALTab binds every payout.

17
00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.020
KeeperHub simulates first.

18
00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:53.260
Consumed proof cannot move again.

19
00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:59.350
KeeperHub submitted once with operator
authorization.

20
00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:02.530
Its receipt and Base Sepolia independently
match

21
00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.570
transaction, settlement ID, and ledger
hash.

22
00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:10.052
Agents use the same safety rail through
nine production MCP tools.

23
00:01:10.372 --> 00:01:12.652
FINALTab never holds wallet keys.

24
00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:17.000
A real MCP client authenticates, lists
nine tools,

25
00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:20.330
allocates the receipt, prepares V2 typed
data,

26
00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:22.450
and creates an approval challenge.

27
00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:27.010
Then it stops: no wallet signature,
submit, or value move.

28
00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:30.590
A read-only panel verifies the retained
settlement.

29
00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:34.527
FINALTab: KeeperHub executes. Anyone
verifies.
